  "steps": [
    "Sauté 100g boiled rajma + 70g low fat paneer (I used milky mist) in ½ tsp olive oil. Add 1/2 tbsp peri peri masala and cook till golden.",
    "Sauté 1/2 cup mixed bell peppers + 1/2 cup boiled corn in 1/2 tsp butter, salt, pepper for 3-4 mins.",
    "For dressing: roast 1 tomato on flame until the skin is black, peel, and chop. Roughly grind the tomato, ½ onion, lemon juice, chilli flakes, salt, pepper, 1 tbsp ketchup into a salsa. Whisk in 2 tbsp Greek yogurt and chopped coriander. (I used Epigamia).",
    "Assemble: rajma–paneer mix → veggies → dressing. Optionally, add 3-4 crushed baked nachos on top if you want some crunch."
  ],
